bullnym
=======

This service started from posd, the point-of-sale service written by Lee
Salminen for Scuttle (the pos branch of Bitcoin-Jungle/scuttle, commit
48fc3ade1). The first commit of this repository is his code, unchanged:
the service, its API documentation, the terminal web app, the signet
deployment scripts and the integration tests. The store registration and
owner login, the sale engine, the rate lock, the QR code, the history and
CSV export, the on-chain watch-only wallet and the web app design are his
work.

posd was released under the MIT license, as part of Scuttle. Its copyright
notice is kept in LICENSE.

The protections against floods and address exhaustion, the reserved names
and the LUD-22 negotiation shape come from the Liquid Bullnym service
(BullishNode/bullnym).
